# Runtime supports two reviewed templates. Keep the full upstream checkout out
# of the build context and re-include only those exact authoritative JSON files.
standards/idta-submodel-templates/**
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Digital nameplate/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Digital nameplate/3/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Digital nameplate/3/0/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Digital nameplate/3/0/1/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Digital nameplate/3/0/1/IDTA 02006-3-0-1_Template_Digital Nameplate.json
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Technical_Data/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Technical_Data/2/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Technical_Data/2/0/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Technical_Data/2/0/1/
!standards/idta-submodel-templates/published/Technical_Data/2/0/1/IDTA 02003_2-0-1_Template_TechnicalData.json
